DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
42792::$$$message_0352_0000_0000$$$::"It is long past noon, lord mage.[lr]::
42793::$$$message_0352_0000_0001$$$::What will you be having for lun[line len=2][wait canskip=0 time=800][hfchance layer=1]Hm."::
42794::$$$message_0352_0000_0002$$$::"(So messy again...)[lr]::
42795::$$$message_0352_0000_0003$$$::He doesn't know how to tidy up, just like his grandson. Perhaps it's a family illness of the Makiri..."::
42796::$$$message_0352_0000_0004$$$::"...(He is from a respectable house, after all. Perhaps he is used to leaving such matters to domestic servants...)"::
42797::$$$message_0352_0000_0005$$$::"...All part of the job, I suppose. I'm not complaining.[lr]::
42798::$$$message_0352_0000_0006$$$::Heave, ho. [se storage=se044.wav]Hm?"::
42799::$$$message_0352_0000_0007$$$::"Oh. [wait canskip=0 time=500][sestop time=1000 nowait=1]Now what's this?"[nolr]::
42800::$$$message_0352_0000_0008$$$::"...How vexing.[lr]::
42801::$$$message_0352_0000_0009$$$::Their refinement drops year after year. I cannot stop the regression even with my perfected techniques..."::
42802::$$$message_0352_0000_0010$$$::"Lord mage.[lr]::
42803::$$$message_0352_0000_0011$$$::I apologize for disturbing your leisure."::
42804::$$$message_0352_0000_0012$$$::"What's all this morning commotion?[lr]::
42805::$$$message_0352_0000_0013$$$::I'm resting. Bother me with the trivialities later."::
42806::$$$message_0352_0000_0014$$$::"It's long past morning, my lord.[lr]::
42807::$$$message_0352_0000_0015$$$::You're losing your sense of time due to being cooped up at home all day."::
42808::$$$message_0352_0000_0016$$$::"What else do you expect? I'm weak to sunlight."::
42809::$$$message_0352_0000_0017$$$::"You lead a rather regimented lifestyle, patrolling the city during the day. What do they call your type nowadays? [wait canskip=0 time=200]...[wait canskip=0 time=200]...[wait canskip=0 time=200]An outbreakman?"::
42810::$$$message_0352_0000_0018$$$::"I believe the word is 'outdoorsman.'[lr]::
42811::$$$message_0352_0000_0019$$$::I am simply gathering intelligence."::
42812::$$$message_0352_0000_0020$$$::"More importantly, lord mage...[lr]::
42813::$$$message_0352_0000_0021$$$::You seem disappointed. Is something the matter?"::
42814::$$$message_0352_0000_0022$$$::"Ah, well... It's Monta."::
42815::$$$message_0352_0000_0023$$$::"Please don't feel competitive towards a household celebrity.[lr]::
42816::$$$message_0352_0000_0024$$$::Have you forgotten what your own profession is?"::
42817::$$$message_0352_0000_0025$$$::"Mmm. I suppose I am being a bit immodest for a mage.[lr]::
42818::$$$message_0352_0000_0026$$$::But you see, Sakura..."::
42819::$$$message_0352_0000_0027$$$::"Ahh, it pains me to watch.[lr]::
42820::$$$message_0352_0000_0028$$$::I can't help but be curious about the host of this show. He's kind of like you, Grandfather."::
42821::$$$message_0352_0000_0029$$$::"...said that, and I've been curious to see what sort of luminary she was talking about."::
42822::$$$message_0352_0000_0030$$$::"Even if I've been secretly following him ever since his debut."::
42823::$$$message_0352_0000_0031$$$::[large]"If I may change the topic, lord mage..."[rf][nolr]::
42824::$$$message_0352_0000_0032$$$::"I was organizing the basement earlier, and came across this.[lr]::
42825::$$$message_0352_0000_0033$$$::I believe it is a letter from your granddaughter."::
42826::$$$message_0352_0000_0034$$$::"Oh? Show me.[lr]::
42827::$$$message_0352_0000_0035$$$::Let's see..."::
42828::$$$message_0352_0001_0000$$$::"Dear Grandfather,[lr]::
42829::$$$message_0352_0001_0001$$$::I've prepared an onsen as a gift of appreciation."::
42830::$$$message_0352_0002_0000$$$::"Rider and I are working on it with all our heart, so I hope you can visit."::
42831::$$$message_0352_0003_0000$$$::"P.S.[lr]::
42832::$$$message_0352_0003_0001$$$::This is legit. Super serious.[heart]"[nolr][p]::
42833::$$$message_0352_0003_0002$$$::"Hahaha![lr]::
42834::$$$message_0352_0003_0003$$$::How admirable, Sakura!"::
42835::$$$message_0352_0003_0004$$$::"(...Really, though? This letter positively oozes a dark aura not unlike Zabaniya, so to speak.)"::
42836::$$$message_0352_0003_0005$$$::"Prepare to depart, Assassin![lr]::
42837::$$$message_0352_0003_0006$$$::My forgetful granddaughter is doing her best to show filial piety.[lr]::
42838::$$$message_0352_0003_0007$$$::I must be sure to accept it."[p][hfmsg2layer src=0 dest=2][nolr]::
42839::$$$message_0352_0003_0008$$$::"...And he's gone."::
42840::$$$message_0352_0003_0009$$$::"Like father, like daughter, I suppose.[lr]::
42841::$$$message_0352_0003_0010$$$::This is a trap, any way you slice it."::

